<title>CHILE: Entel Chile first-half net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Entel Chile first-half net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Entel Chile SA on Tuesday reported the following results in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>			     H1 1997	    H1 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	    10.51    profit   7.12</p>
<p>    Operating profit    14.62    profit  12.54</p>
<p>    Non-operating loss   2.45	loss   5.25</p>
<p>    Revenues		76.78		69.21</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
